  "description": "Ja-Yeon, a recessive omega, gets into Hankuk University to find the mysterious \"Gong Ju\" who saved him when he was in middle school. He immediately finds Gong-Ju, but it turns out his savior has a twin! Ja-Yeon tries to figure out which alpha twin helped him and believes it to be Gong Ju-Eun. Convinced of his savior’s identity Ja-Yeon asks Gong Ju-Dan to help him win over the icy twin, but Ju-Dan won’t do it for free.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
